併購方式不同所產生的稅負影響往往會有大相逕庭的情況發生。","cateLink":"https:\/\/udn.com\/news\/cate\/6644","cateTitle":"產經","time":{"dateTime":"2026-03-02 13:35","date":"2026-03-02 13:35"},"content_level":"開放閱讀","story_list":"list_公開收購"},{"url":"https:\/\/pgw.udn.com.tw\/gw\/photo.php?u=https:\/\/udn.com\/upf\/2017_news\/noimg_cid7225_9.jpg","titleLink":"https:\/\/udn.com\/news\/story\/6811\/9345096?from=searchresult","title":"Stripe擬收購同業PayPal","paragraph":"彭博資訊報導，知情人士透露，支付處理業者Stripe考慮收購PayPal全部或部分事業。","cateLink":"https:\/\/udn.com\/news\/cate\/7225","cateTitle":"全球","time":{"dateTime":"2026-02-26 02:41","date":"2026-02-26 02:41"},"content_level":"開放閱讀","story_list":"list_公開收購"},{"url":"https:\/\/pgw.udn.com.tw\/gw\/photo.php?u=https:\/\/udn.com\/upf\/2017_news\/noimg_cid6644_3.jpg","titleLink":"https:\/\/udn.com\/news\/story\/7241\/9344712?from=searchresult","title":"程泰收購裕國普通股 已達最低收購數量","paragraph":"程泰（1583）機械公開收購裕國冷凍冷藏公司普通股已達最低收購數量，程泰25日表示，已有股東應賣598.8萬股，公開收購...","cateLink":"https:\/\/udn.com\/news\/cate\/6644","cateTitle":"產經","time":{"dateTime":"2026-02-25 19:14","date":"2026-02-25 19:14"},"content_level":"開放閱讀","story_list":"list_公開收購"},{"url":"https:\/\/pgw.udn.com.tw\/gw\/photo.php?u=https:\/\/uc.udn.com.tw\/photo\/2026\/02\/25\/realtime\/34520648.jpg&s=Y&x=0&y=0&sw=5760&sh=3840&exp=3600","titleLink":"https:\/\/udn.com\/news\/story\/6811\/9343259?from=searchresult","title":"彭博：未上市數位支付巨人Stripe 擬併購業界先驅 PayPal","paragraph":"彭博引述知情人士報導，支付處理公司 Stripe 考慮收購 PayPal全部或部分事業。","cateLink":"https:\/\/udn.com\/news\/cate\/7225","cateTitle":"全球","time":{"dateTime":"2026-02-25 10:48","date":"2026-02-25 10:48"},"content_level":"開放閱讀","story_list":"list_公開收購"},{"url":"https:\/\/pgw.udn.com.tw\/gw\/photo.php?u=https:\/\/udn.com\/upf\/2017_news\/noimg_cid6645_0.jpg","titleLink":"https:\/\/udn.com\/news\/story\/7253\/9342307?from=searchresult","title":"閎暉去年EPS 1.67元 跨足電力市場","paragraph":"機構整合元件廠閎暉（3311）昨（24）日公告去年每股純益1.67元，較前年每股純益0.81元大幅成長。","cateLink":"https:\/\/udn.com\/news\/cate\/6645","cateTitle":"股市","t